{"title":"Increasing sequence","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><i>This article is a stub.  Help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=Increasing_sequence&amp;action=edit\">expanding it</a></span>.</i>\n</p><p>A <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Sequence\" title=\"Sequence\">sequence</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/a/1ba1ea2ff1caf77831140b0a5972314412f47af1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1, x_2, x_3, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"97\" height=\"11\" /> of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Real_number\" title=\"Real number\">real numbers</a> is called an <b>increasing sequence</b> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/3/2e3b8ad874c4db0f3b67903e905f975428b7f5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 \\leq x_2 \\leq x_3 \\leq \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"146\" height=\"14\" />.  If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/8/4d8b8986078fe800bcf24e7025f6d777bfcfdd3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 &lt; x_2 &lt; x_3 \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"124\" height=\"12\" />, the sequence is called <i>strictly increasing</i>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Increasing_sequence&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Decreasing_sequence\" title=\"Decreasing sequence\">Decreasing sequence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Monotonic_sequence&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Monotonic sequence (page does not exist)\">Monotonic sequence</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018091113\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 27/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 594/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.971      1 Template:Stub\n100.00%    5.971      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3989:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018091113 and revision id 10422. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}